DeepTrolsTokenHub
-----------------

This directory (internal/guardrails) contains code ported from TokenHub
(https://github.com/astaxie/TokenHub), which is licensed under the Apache
License, Version 2.0.

Copied on 2026-08-25 from TokenHub backend/internal/guardrails:
  - engine.go (deterministic matchers + work budgets + decision merging)
  - policy.go (policy/detection item/binding models + validation + normalization)
  - qwen_detector.go (Qwen3Guard model detector)
  - engine_test.go / policy_test.go / qwen_detector_test.go

Adaptations:
  - Removed GORM struct tags and TableName() methods (this repository persists
    with pgx; schema lives in migrations/000016_guardrails).
  - No functional changes to the copied logic.

